  "beats": [
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "Elections in the United States were held on November 3, 2026.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1384060175:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "Democrats won Senate seats previously held by Republicans in Iowa, Ohio, South Carolina, Maine, Kansas, North Carolina, and Texas, with the last two won by double digits.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1384060175:16"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "Seats in Alaska and Mississippi remained uncalled by major media outlets as of November 5, with Democrats favored to win both, as the article records.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1384060175:16"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:25Z",
      "text": "Of 35 Senate races this year, Democrats won 20 and Republicans won 13, with 2 not yet called.",
      "cites": [
        "elex:2026-united-states-senate-elections:the-senate-table"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:31Z",
      "text": "Democrats gained seats in Iowa, North Carolina, Kansas, Maine, Ohio, South Carolina and Texas.",
      "cites": [
        "elex:2026-united-states-senate-elections:senate-ia",
        "elex:2026-united-states-senate-elections:senate-nc",
        "elex:2026-united-states-senate-elections:senate-ks",
        "elex:2026-united-states-senate-elections:senate-me",
        "elex:2026-united-states-senate-elections:senate-oh-special",
        "elex:2026-united-states-senate-elections:senate-sc",
        "elex:2026-united-states-senate-elections:senate-tx"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:39Z",
      "text": "Of 36 governor's races this year, Democrats won 0, Republicans won 0, and 36 were not yet called.",
      "cites": [
        "elex:2026-united-states-gubernatorial-elections:governors-table"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:49Z",
      "text": "In the House, Democrats hold 253 seats and Republicans 157, with 25 still to be called; 218 seats make a majority.",
      "cites": [
        "elex:2026-united-states-house-of-representatives-elections:house-infobox"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:55Z",
      "text": "In the race tables, 52 districts changed party and 29 are not yet called.",
      "cites": [
        "elex:2026-united-states-house-of-representatives-elections:house-table"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:01:03Z",
      "text": "Readers also turned to articles on Jon Ossoff, with 611,863 readers, the United States midterm election, with 523,575, and the 2026 United States Senate elections, with 493,851.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Jon_Ossoff:2026-11-04",
        "views:en:United_States_midterm_election:2026-11-04",
        "views:en:2026_United_States_Senate_elections:2026-11-04"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:01:12Z",
      "text": "On 4 November 2026, 1,153,444 people read the article on the 2026 United States elections, about 46 times the usual daily figure.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:2026_United_States_elections:2026-11-04",
        "views:en:2026_United_States_elections:prior"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:01:19Z",
      "text": "The article was read in 11 languages, and after English, German led with 35,408 readers.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:2026_United_States_elections:2026-11-04",
        "views:de:Wahlen_in_den_Vereinigten_Staaten_2026:2026-11-04"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:01:26Z",
      "text": "On the globe, each language glows where it is mainly spoken, brighter for more readers, and a language is not a country.",
      "cites": [
        "views:de:Wahlen_in_den_Vereinigten_Staaten_2026:2026-11-04",
        "views:fr:Élections_de_2026_aux_États-Unis:2026-11-04",
        "views:zh:2026年美國選舉:2026-11-04",
        "views:it:Elezioni_parlamentari_negli_Stati_Uniti_d'America_del_2026:2026-11-04",
        "views:pt:Eleições_nos_Estados_Unidos_em_2026:2026-11-04",
        "views:fa:انتخابات_۲۰۲۶_ایالات_متحده_آمریکا:2026-11-04"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:01:36Z",
      "text": "The sources are Wikipedia articles, Wikimedia pageviews and Wikidata, and each caption links to the evidence it rests on.",
      "cites": [
